; ABNF mirror (descriptive, not test-parsed — the real byte-level walker is
; ../📡️component.protocol.semio, walked by dsl::walk_protocol) for stdio.semio.audio.mutations
; (binary) — the REAL binary `SemioAudioMutation::encode_op`/`decode_op` frame, NOT the old
; `print_op().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut.
document  = format tag payload
format    = OCTET                ; OP_BINARY_FORMAT, currently 1
tag       = OCTET                ; SemioAudioMutation variant ordinal, 0-9
payload   = *OCTET                ; variant's own argument text — see ../../🦀️component.rs's print_audio_mutation_args
